cards on the table. We could deﬁne two classes, one for hands and one for
piles, but there is not much diﬀerence between them. So we’ll use one class,
called Hand, for both hands and piles. Here’s what the deﬁnition looks like:
public class Hand extends CardCollection {
public Hand(String label) {
